  documentID: test_example
  title: Test Document
  body: "This is a test document.\n\nThis document contains placeholder text to demonstrate
    the document system. In a real game, you would replace this with actual document
    content such as research notes, old papers, transcripts, or other in-game materials
    that the player discovers during interviews.\n\nKey features:\n\u2022 Documents
    persist across day changes\n\u2022 Only unlocked documents are visible\n\u2022
    Multiple documents can be created and stored\n\u2022 Documents are unlocked via
    dialogue nodes\n\nYou can unlock documents by calling:\nGameStateManager.Instance.UnlockDocument(\"test_example\");\n\nThis
    document will appear in the filing cabinet and can be read by the player."
  unlockedBy: GameStart
